   (CC BY-SA 4.0), with the underlying Chekhov works in the public domain.
   Attribution, fixed revision URLs, and hashes are in corpus/source-registry.csv
   and corpus/corpus-manifest.json. See LICENSES/CC-BY-SA-4.0.txt.

4. Project Gutenberg research-source files retain the Project Gutenberg terms
   embedded in those files. They are included only in the research snapshot.

5. Modern Chinese published translations are not licensed by this release and
   are not included. Bibliographic target records do not grant text rights.

Where a file carries a more specific notice, that notice controls.

